	"Name": "Let Me Shop",
	"Author": "MindMeltMax",
	"TagLine": "Allows you to still process geodes and shop while upgrading tools",
	"Description": "This was requested by [StardewSweetHeart](https://github.com/StardewSweetheart) on the [Stardew mod idea's GitHub](https://github.com/StardewModders/mod-ideas/issues/1094).\n\nIt's going to allow you to both buy stuff from Clint and process geodes while your tools are upgrading.\nBeing able to process geodes can be toggled on or off.\n\n**How to install :**\n1. Install [Smapi](http://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Installing_SMAPI)\n2. Unzip the file and place it in the mod folder\n\n[[Source Code]](https://github.com/MindMeltMax/Stardew-Valley-Mods/tree/main/LetMeShop)",
